Goblin Auto v3 | Fisch - FischFright 3 | Delta
Run while the FischFright 3 goblins are spawned (every 5 min).

Flow per goblin (nearest first):
TP -> Talk -> pick difficulty -> read objective -> do it -> TP back -> Talk -> claim

Auto objectives : type in chat, dance, jump, walk
Skipped + logged: catch / perfect catch / drown / burn / freeze / trick-or-treat / guess / insult
Dialog is driven through the GUI (buttons + text) because the dialog remotes
have not been captured yet. Every remote call is logged for the next version.

Buttons: Auto ON/OFF | Copy report | Clear
Re-running replaces the previous instance.
]]

local Players = game:GetService("Players")
